{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/9c1e8ec907a39e47ea266adef31642b9.avif?t=1764219308\" width=546 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DLsite 2023\u00a0Newcomer Award Nominated</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/4d14f7a8f278a87f603acafeaef015ba.poster.avif?t=1764219308\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/4d14f7a8f278a87f603acafeaef015ba.webm?t=1764219308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/4d14f7a8f278a87f603acafeaef015ba.mp4?t=1764219308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1764219308\" width=616 height=64 /></span>There was a girl named Laura who lived in a remote village called Hatayaki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was close friends with a girl named Lunaroa who lived next door, and they promised to marry in Yuriscene, a country where women can marry each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reuniting after five years, the two girls were swept up in an incident and set off on a journey to Yuriscene, overcoming countless difficulties to fulfill their promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/97482ccf1a60a80004af02da00a2d2e1.avif?t=1764219308\" width=250 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laura</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl living in Hatayaki Village with her parents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a simple and pure girl loved by the villagers in various ways,. She proposed to Lunaroa in Yuriscene, asking her to marry her when Lunaroa had to leave Hatayaki Village five years ago. They've maintained their engagement and warmed their affection through letters since Lunaroa accepted her proposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/915abba798b59e39fc642f8d68a3e7db.avif?t=1764219308\" width=250 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunaroa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who was born and raised in Hatayaki Village, Laura's childhood friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invited to the Magic Academy as a special scholarship student due to her talent for magic, she has been separated from Laura for 5 years, but has continued to keep her love for Laura warm through their correspondence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497170/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1764219308\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 hours gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of beautiful CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto battle</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2497170?t=1764219308","background_raw"